OL,3,GNEWSASolar farm could harm food
OL,4,Asecurity, council says
OL,5,
OL,6,FA parish council has raised strong
OL,7,Fobjections to a planned solar farm on
OL,8,Fagricultural land that could generate
OL,9,Fenough electricity to power more than
OL,10,F15,000 homes a year.
OL,12,FThe development would cover about 260
OL,13,Facres of land on the Shuttleworth
OL,14,FEstate near Sheerhatch Wood in
OL,15,FBedfordshire.
OL,17,FIn an open letter, Jason Whaley,
OL,18,Fchairman of Cople Parish Council, said
OL,19,Fthe proposal would "undermine food
OL,20,Fsecurity".
OL,23,APub: 08-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
